Revoke one binding; earlier admissions fail at their commit

Usage: cs collaboration revoke [OPTIONS] <ID>

Arguments:
  <ID>  Binding ID (cb-…)

Options:
      --config <PATH>  Path to configuration file
  -v, --verbose        Enable verbose output
      --json           Output in JSON format
  -h, --help           Print help
